warning[pointer_lifetime]: `p` points into `a`, which may be resized: push(*a)
  --> tests/lint/pointer_lifetime/summaries-bad.jai:23:10
   |
 3 | grow :: (a: *[..] int) {} @GrowsArray
   |         ----------------- invalidation inferred through this call
   ...
 5 |     grow(a);
   |     ------- invalidation inferred through this call
   ...
 9 |     wrapper(a);
   |     ---------- invalidation inferred through this call
   ...
20 |     p := *a[0];
   |          ----- pointer derived here
   ...
22 |     push(*a);
   |     -------- `a` storage invalidated here
23 |     sink(p);
   |          ^ pointer used here after its storage was invalidated
   |
   = help: take the pointer again after growth, or store an index instead

